[Bb]You alone are [Cm7]holy
[F9]You alone are [Bb]worthy
[Cm7]Only You alone [Bb/D]deserve my [Fsus4]praise[F9]
[Bb]So I come before [Cm7]You
[F9]I honor and adore [Bb]You
[Cm7]You alone are wor[Bb/D]thy of my [Fsus4]praise[F]
